  "intentionalRuntimeChanges": [
    "Removed the encoded Qualtrics generator and patchQualtricsGeneratorSource runtime engine after materializing the exact final generator.",
    "Moved regression suites out of production startup and exposed an on-demand loader.",
    "Replaced the startup roster regression execution with manual debug loading.",
    "Added a lazy, generated Qualtrics source carrier to preserve srcdoc storage compatibility under file://.",
    "Extracted reusable Qualtrics formatting, corrective-context, urgency, and organization-summary logic into qualtrics/insights.js.",
    "Added generalized representative/team/coach lookup display fields with calculated values and ordered conditional formatting.",
    "Replaced new data-package export with a versioned normalized JSON contract while retaining legacy workbook import compatibility.",
